The statistical workflow is adapted from the msqrob2TMT paper and its
companion vignettes (Vandenbulcke, Vanderaa, Crook, Martens and Clement,
Molecular and Cellular Proteomics 2025, 24(7):101002). The companion
repository at https://github.com/statOmics/msqrob2tmt_paper carried no
licence file when it was read on 21 September 2026, so its code was
treated as all rights reserved: it was read and cited, and the code in
this repository is an independent implementation. The msqrob2 book
(https://statomics.github.io/msqrob2Book/) is CC BY-SA 4.0 and is
credited in the README.
